seg-82b7ed4e70af = <c1/> is the tree that GitHub Pages serves as <a1>https://kshana.dev</a1>: the pages (<c2/>, <c3/>, <c4/>, <c5/>, <c6/>, <c7/>), the documentation under <c8/>, and Kshana Studio under <c9/> (served at <a2>https://kshana.dev/studio/</a2>), the app that runs the engine in the browser as WebAssembly (WASM) with no server-side computation and nothing uploaded. The Studio has two views of one engine: the Simple view (<c10/>, the answer first in plain words) and the Advanced view (<c11/>, the full dashboard), which shares the Simple view's engine, worker, modules and data through <c12/>.

