seg-b681e66130e5 = The port is deterministic: a second run writes nothing, and <c1/> exits { "1" } if <c2/> is not what the port would write. It carries over the site build's crawl files unchanged (each page's canonical, social-card and schema.org tags, <c3/>, <c4/>, <c5/>, <c6/>), checks them, writes <c7/>, <c8/> and the forwarding page at the Studio's old address (<c9/>, to <c10/>), and points every page at the local fonts and script libraries (below).

