seg-35094cb7ed04 = Each module in <c1/> is pure logic with a matching <c2/>; the Studio's DOM (Document Object Model, the page's element tree) drivers are <c3/> (the Simple view) and <c4/> (the Advanced view). Continuous integration runs every one of these as its own step and fails if a test file under <c5/> has no step.

