seg-763503746a48 = GitHub Pages answers a missing address with <c1/> and status { "404" }. The port makes that page from the home page's own shell (navigation, footer, search) around a short message with links to Home, Docs and the Studio. Every address in it is written from the site root, because it is served at any depth.

