seg-a64ed190233a = Until { "v0.28.0" } the site was a single page, and everything lived behind a fragment on <c1/> (<c2/>, <c3/>, share links as <c4/>, embeds as <c5/>; an embed link's old tab name, such as <c6/>, opens the Studio tab that replaced it). <c7/> lists every such address that published material uses and where it lands now; the home page loads <c8/>, generated from that list, to send them there. Add a case to the list before retiring any address.

